{
  "_comment": "Maps VantagePoint History Grid XLSX columns to pattern_bars Pydantic field names defined in schemas.py. Single source of truth for VP -> catalog field translation. Updates to this file are the only code change required when VP export columns drift. Per architecture §2.5 (schema as protection layer) and §6 EC-035, EC-037, EC-063 (historical manifest failures). NOTE on merged headers: VP merges the top-row header across grouped columns (Professional Sentiment spans 12-13, Neural Index spans 14-15, Triple Cross spans 16-17-18). openpyxl returns the header value only for the first cell of each merge; continuation cells return null. The `header_top` field below records the LITERAL openpyxl value per cell, not the semantic group label.",

  "manifest_version": "2.1",
  "manifest_date": "2026-05-20",
  "pairs_with_schema_version": "schemas.py v2.2",
